      "title": "Plan for the peak, not the average",
      "chapter": "insight",
      "body": "Traffic isn’t flat: people browse in the evening and around big events. A typical peak is 2–3× the daily average.\n\nSize for 3× and the lone server is clearly overwhelmed.",
