      "body": "• **Users × actions ÷ 100k s** gives average requests per second.\n• Multiply by **2–3×** for the peak, and size for that.\n• **Servers** = peak ÷ per-server capacity, plus headroom.\n• **Storage** = items/day × size × 365 × copies.\n• Estimate **bytes out** and **memory** too — they often decide the design.",
